			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.14.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. On 0.1.10 or newer you can also update from the game: Updates → Install.\n\n### Added\n- **Custom scoreboard** (Visuals → Scoreboard): your own version of the server's sidebar. Drag lines into any order, turn them on or off, add your own text with `&` colour codes and `{time}` `{fps}` `{ping}` placeholders. Animated themes: Solid, Gradient, Aurora lights, Matrix, Fire and Ocean, with adjustable colours, particles, opacity, rounded corners and border. Editable header and footer, movable and resizable. **Hide server's** also hides Lunar's scoreboard.\n- **Chat Cleaner** (Combat → Chat Cleaner): hides the slayer messages that repeat every fight (hitshields, mechanics, splits, anchors, Soulcry), group by group, plus your own filters.\n- **Disable debuffs** (Visuals → World): hides blindness and darkness fog, the nausea wobble, the pumpkin mask, the freezing frame and, optionally, the flames on screen. On your screen only; the effects still apply.\n- **Clear Rift haze** (Visuals → World): removes the thick purple fog in the Rift, optionally with a normal blue sky.\n\n### Changed\n- **Menu:** each section lists its pages down the left, so you can switch between them in one click, and long pages scroll smoothly. Settings save when you leave the section.\n- **Updates:** click the version number in the menu to open the update settings and changelog. The refresh button still checks for updates.\n- **Dragon hitboxes** moved to Visuals → World."
		},
