			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.13.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. On 0.1.10 or newer you can also update from the game: Updates → Install.\n\n### Fixed\n- **Riftborn Seraph fight detection:** the features now turn on when the sidebar shows \"Riftborn Seraph\" (they were waiting for \"Voidgloom Seraph\" before, so nothing ran).\n- **Anchor outlines:** the placed sea-lantern anchors are found and outlined after the \"hangs itself on N anchors\" message. The mod keeps scanning for a few seconds until it has found them all, and clears the outlines when every anchor is down.\n\n### Added\n- **Follow action bar** (Riftborn settings): auto attunement can also use the \"Right-click → FLESH/ICHOR/VOID/AETHER\" hint above the hotbar when it can't read a target's tag."
		},
