			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.11.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. Mod Menu is optional. On 0.1.10 you can also update from the game: Updates → Install.\n\n### New\n- **AFK Helper** (QoL): running `/afk` starts a session with a dragon tracker HUD (drag to move, scroll to resize). If you get warped or moved to another lobby it runs `/afk` again, and if your connection drops it reconnects and goes back to `/afk`. Close the AFK menu yourself to stop it. Test tools let you try it out: drop the connection, switch lobby, or add a fake reward.\n- **Combat** category in the menu.\n- **Riftborn Seraph**: anchor outlines around every sea lantern after \"It hangs itself on N anchors\", until each one breaks (colour, fill, width, range and through-walls adjustable), and auto attunement for the Fleshrend and Voidfang daggers (off by default). `/gaseraph item`, `/gaseraph target` and `/gaseraph status` show what it reads.\n- **Bone Swap**: one key throws every Bonemerang in your hotbar, with an adjustable delay and random variation, then goes to the slot you choose."
		},
