			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.7.jar` below and put it in your `.minecraft/mods` folder (replacing the old GolemAddons jar), next to Fabric API. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. Mod Menu is optional. From now on the mod can check for and install updates itself (Updates, from the refresh icon in the menu).\n\nPress **K** in game to open the menu.\n\n### New\n- **Reorganised menu:** Selling (Mining Auto-Sell, Dragon Seller, Sell Settings), QoL and Visuals, with every screen restyled.\n- **Terminals (QoL):** solvers for all six Floor 7 terminals with a compact, recolourable GUI, wrong-click blocking, hover click, auto terms, dimming (darken and saturation) of wrong items, ping-aware Melody timing, and `/gatestterms` practice terminals.\n- **Held item animations (Visuals):** position, rotation, size and swing speed of your held item, based on OdinLegacy's animations, with a live preview, shareable presets and a no-equip-animation option.\n- **Camera (QoL):** skip the front F5 view, custom third-person distance, clip through blocks.\n- **Update checker and auto-updater** from these GitHub releases (checksum-verified).\n\n### Changed\n- Party Finder no longer uses roles.\n\nSee the README for details."
